			;何か言わせると派手に矛盾しそうなのでYOGOREだけ見る
			CASE 616
				IF YOGORE:(616) >= 1000
					PRINTFORML 「Really now... The state of this room is utterly lamentable...」
					PRINTFORMW 「It's because she keeps putting off cleaning even after I've told her about it...」
					SIF CFLAG:76:現在位置 == 616
						PRINTFORMW 「...Hey! Komachi!! Are you listening to me?!」
				ELSEIF YOGORE:(616) < 100
					PRINTFORML 「Well now... This room is much cleaner than I expected.」
					PRINTFORMW 「I'm surprised such a negligent girl could keep it this clean.」
					SIF CFLAG:76:現在位置 == 616
						PRINTFORMW 「...I'm seeing you in a new light, Komachi. Make sure you keep this up, okay?」
					SIF YOGORE:(615) > 1000
						PRINTFORMW （I'd better clean \@ CFLAG:MASTER:初期位置 == 615 ? our # my \@ room too...）
				ELSEIF CFLAG:76:現在位置 == 616
					PRINTFORMDW Eiki is evaluating the state of Komachi's room...
					PRINTFORML 「I suppose this level of maintenance earns a passing grade.」
					PRINTFORML 「Komachi, as we are in a position of authority here, it is imperative we maintain respectable personal hygiene and grooming.」
					PRINTFORML 「An important part of that is obviously keeping our personal quarters neat and tidy. Furthermore...」
					PRINTFORMDW It seems Komachi is getting the brunt of this lecture...
				ELSE
					PRINTFORML 「I'd rather not enter my subordinates' quarters without their permission.」
					PRINTFORMW 「It seems like there are no immediate problems here, so let's move somewhere else.」
				ENDIF
			;風呂
			CASE 617
				IF RAND:2 == 1
					PRINTFORML 「The bath here uses the fires of Hell for heating.」
					PRINTFORML 「So it's okay to keep them hot all day.」
					PRINTFORMW 「It's this building's single point of luxury.」
				ELSE
					PRINTFORML 「%K30_C_NAME(MASTER)%, how is the water temperature?」
					PRINTFORML 「I prefer it hotter than this, but...」
					PRINTFORMW 「Since we're here together, I would rather match it to your needs.」
				ENDIF
			;三途の川
			;瓔花口上参考にしました
			CASE 620
				IF YOUBI_MATCH(DAY, "月水金") && INRANGE(TIME / 60, 10, 15) && ((CFLAG:[[小町]]:現在位置 != 三途の川 && MAIN_MAP != 6) || (CFLAG:[[小町]]:現在位置 != 602 && MAIN_MAP == 6)) && !CFLAG:76:産休中
					PRINTFORML 「...So Komachi's boat is still docked, after all. Unfortunately, this isn't a strange sight.」
					PRINTFORMW 「I'll have to speak to her about this again...」
				ELSEIF SHIRAHU(127) && CFLAG:127:現在位置 == CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置 && !RAND:3
					PRINTFORML 「...!」
					PRINTFORMDW Eiki starts to say something, but suddenly lowers her eyes.
					PRINTFORMDW In front of you is a stillborn child happily stacking stones...
					PRINTFORML 
					PRINTFORML 「...In return for the ability to judge others, I lost my protective powers as Jizou.」
					PRINTFORML 「So I can no longer... protect these children.」
					PRINTFORML 「Even as a Yama, I am denied the opportunity to lead them to the afterlife... I truly cannot do anything.」
					PRINTFORMW 「Each time I come here, I am made painfully aware of how powerless I am.」
				ELSEIF CFLAG:1805 > 2
					PRINTFORML 「...As I come here, I am reminded of the depth of my own sins.」
					PRINTFORMW 「When I am finally relieved of my duties as a Yama, I am sure to receive an unimaginably severe judgement...」
				ELSEIF CFLAG:子供人数 || CFLAG:妊娠自覚状態
					PRINTFORML 「...This is a truly painful place.」
					PRINTFORMW 「As a mother myself, now blessed with children...」
					PRINTFORML 「It's painfully evident to me... the sorrow and grief of parents who have had to send off their children here.」
					PRINTFORMW 「I'm not confident that I could endure that...」
				ELSE
					PRINTFORML 「%K30_C_NAME(MASTER)%. If you ever come to have children of your own...」
					PRINTFORMW 「Please care for them to the utmost of your abilities. Please watch over them to adulthood.」
					PRINTFORMW 「Are we understood? You must, you absolutely must. Please promise me...」
				ENDIF
			;八雲邸・畜生界・霊長園 = 映姫様は出入りしない場所
			CASE 630, 680, 690
				IF RAND:2 == 1
					PRINTFORML 「What do you intend to do all the way out here?」
					PRINTFORMW 「I have no business in a place like this.」
				ELSE
					PRINTFORML 「...Personally, I would like to avoid being here if possible.」
					PRINTFORMW 「Let's move somewhere else.」
				ENDIF
			;彼岸
			CASE 640
				SELECTCASE RAND:6
					CASE 0
						PRINTFORML 「The Sanzu River separates Higan from the world of the living, which is crossed in a Shinigami's ferry.」
						PRINTFORMW 「...At least, that's how it should be. But lately, some flying people have been coming and causing trouble.」
					CASE 1
						PRINTFORML 「Some of the flowers that bloom here house the souls of the dead.」
						PRINTFORMW 「Please take care not to pluck or damage any of them.」
					CASE 2
						PRINTFORML 「...It feels like the number of flowers here have increased lately.」
						PRINTFORMW 「Perhaps some disaster has befallen the outside world...」
					CASE 3
						PRINTFORML 「The number of unjudged souls has been increasing...」
						PRINTFORMW 「A Yama doesn't really need to rest, but at the same time I must follow company policies.」
						PRINTFORMW 「It's a difficult position to be in.」
					CASE 4
						PRINTFORML 「The other Yama? Maybe you've never met them, but they certainly do work here.」
						PRINTFORMW 「Judging the existence of someone based on whether you've seen them or not... Please refrain from making such rude comments.」
					CASE 5
						PRINTFORML 「I believe the failings of a subordinate are the superior's responsibility. It seems I also have a long way to go.」
						PRINTFORMW 「Therefore, I intend to continue educating Komachi until she changes her ways.」
				ENDSELECT
			;白玉楼庭
			CASE 650
				IF RAND:2 == 1
					PRINTFORML 「I recommend you keep your distance from that ancient tree over there.」
					PRINTFORMW 「...I won't go into the details, but it's dangerous.」
				ELSE
					PRINTFORML 「The cherry blossoms there don't bloom no matter how long you wait, but...」
					PRINTFORMW 「That's the way it should be. Please leave them the way they are.」
				ENDIF
			;白玉楼
			CASE 660
				IF RAND:2 == 1
					PRINTFORML 「This is a large and beautiful mansion, but please don't cause trouble here.」
					PRINTFORMW 「Assuming you don't want the gardener here to misunderstand and cut you down, that is.」
				ELSE
					PRINTFORML 「Please watch your manners when speaking to the lady of this mansion.」
					PRINTFORMW 「If you underestimate her because of her leisurely attitude, you may regret it.」
				ENDIF
			;地獄 = MAIN_MAPでは該当場所無し？
			CASE 670
				PRINTFORML 「You sure do go where you please, don't you?」
				PRINTFORMW 「I've never met a human who could enter and leave this place so freely.」
		ENDSELECT
	ELSE
		;通常会話をお招き部屋でも使うため別ルーチン
		CALL K30_TALK_NORMAL
	ENDIF
ENDIF
RETURN 1
