			PRINTFORML 「I see, so any human could travel to and from Higan with the right knowledge and skill...」
			PRINTFORMW 「...Hmm?」
		CASE 3
			PRINTFORML 「Kutaka is a very diligent and considerate girl.」
			PRINTFORMW 「Please don't trouble her by asking anything unreasonable of her.」
		CASE 4
			PRINTFORML 「It's wisest not to set foot in the Animal Realm. You never know what kind of effects it might have on you.」
			PRINTFORMW 「...Though since you already travel freely to and from Higan, maybe you would be okay.」
		CASE 5
			PRINTFORML 「Even if you say you'd like to be complimented sometimes...」
			PRINTFORMW 「A compliment for someone who spends all their time in carefree whimsy like yourself...」
			PRINTFORMW 「Compliments... Appreciation...」
			PRINTFORML 「Ah, I could give you an award.」
			PRINTFORMW 「How about an award for "most sinful"?」
		CASE 6
			IF TALENT:MASTER:清掃中毒
				PRINTFORMW 「Even though we've been talking for some time, doesn't it seem like you're more focused on our surroundings...?」
				PRINTFORML 「I see... A cleaning addiction, is it.」
				PRINTFORML 「It seems you are beyond saving...」
				PRINTFORMW 「Perhaps this sin is also the result of indulging in greed...?」
			ELSEIF ABL:MASTER:清掃技能 > 4 && RAND:2 == 1
				PRINTFORML 「Someone of your caliber in cleaning skill...」
				PRINTFORMW 「You should be able to find steady work anywhere, and yet you idle and wander about as always...」
				PRINTFORML 「A passion for cleaning is surely a splendid thing, but...」
				PRINTFORMW 「When I see you, I cannot help but think that it's not the full story.」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORML 「It seems like you value cleanliness very highly.」
				PRINTFORMW 「You're always cleaning up everywhere you go. I think that's a wonderful attitude to have.」
