		CASE 7
			PRINTFORML 「I believe Gensokyo is blessed with more nature than the outside world.」
			PRINTFORML 「Since you have so much free time, why not take up hunting or foraging?」
			PRINTFORMW 「Of course, when you partake of nature's wealth, you must not forget your sense of gratitude.」
