				PRINTFORML 「Have you been properly doing your work?」
			ENDIF
			PRINTFORMW 「I only ever see you wandering aimlessly...」
		CASE 2
			IF 拠点_大家 == 30 || 拠点_大家 == 66
				;キャラデータ.ERBでも『三途の川をうろつくのはやめなさいという心遣い』とあるので
				PRINTFORML 「To be honest, I think it would be best if you move somewhere else...」
				PRINTFORMW 「I'm worried that living in the Higan like this will have some negative effect on your well-being...」
			ELSEIF 拠点_大家 == 56
				PRINTFORML 「I wonder what your intention is, living with a hermit.」
				PRINTFORMW 「Depending on the outcome... I hope you're prepared to face the consequences.」
			ELSEIF 拠点_大家 == 26
				PRINTFORML 「That unknown, shady aspect of you... Perhaps it's related to that gap youkai after all.」
				PRINTFORMW 「I've heard of humans straying over there by accident, but this is the first I've heard of a human actually living there.」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORML 「Have you been showing your gratitude towards %CALLNAME:拠点_大家%-san?」
				PRINTFORML 「There are many ways to do so, such as helping out with %HIS_HER(拠点_大家)% work.」
				PRINTFORMW 「At the very least, make sure you properly greet them each day.」
			ENDIF
		CASE 3
			PRINTFORML 「...I see. So that's how the outside world is these days...」
			PRINTFORMW 「How lamentable. If only I could go and spread my teachings directly.」
		CASE 4
			PRINTFORML 「I won't pull out your tongue. That is the method of a different Yama.」
			PRINTFORML 「I use this instead. Being struck by this inflicts pain proportional to the weight of your sin...」
			PRINTFORMW 「In fact, it may be more painful than having your tongue pulled out.」
		CASE 5
			PRINTFORML 「Have you been properly cleaning your living quarters?」
			PRINTFORMW 「Keeping your environment clear is also part of a virtuous life.」
		CASE 6
			PRINTFORML 「Don't you think you're spending each day prioritizing your immediate happiness too much?」
			PRINTFORML 「Death is a much longer period of time than life for a human.」
			PRINTFORMW 「So even if you can't fully comprehend that right now, you must build a virtuous life in preparation of the afterlife.」
		CASE 7
			PRINTFORMW 「For you to come and speak to me of your own will, by any chance do you...」
			PRINTFORMW 「I see you're eager to hear my teachings, yes? That's a commendable attitude to help.」
		CASE 8
			PRINTFORML 「There haven't been many souls qualified for reincarnation recently.」
			PRINTFORML 「That only shows how few people are willing to acknowledge their sins and live a virtuous life...」
			PRINTFORMW 「It is truly lamentable.」
		CASE 9
			PRINTFORML 「What exactly is a virtuous life, you ask...」
			PRINTFORMW 「Naturally, it varies from person to person. For you, hmm...」
			PRINTFORMW 「It would take about 3 full days to explain your case. Would you like to hear?」
		CASE 10
			PRINTFORML 「The face of the Yama for the outside world is pure red.」
			PRINTFORML 「As compensation for the sin of judging the dead, they drink molten copper, which dyes their face red.」
			PRINTFORMW 「I am exempt from such punishment as I am still in training... But it demonstrates just how heavy the sin of judgement is.」
		CASE 11
			IF CFLAG:1901 != 30 && RAND:2 == 1 && !TALENT:思慕
				PRINTFORML 「I don't know all of the details of your relationship with %CALLNAME:(CFLAG:1901)%-san.」
				PRINTFORMW 「Does she really trust you enough that she would offer you lodgings after you suddenly appeared here...?」
				PRINTFORMW 「You're not blackmailing her based on some secret information... Right?」
			ELSEIF (CFLAG:1900 % 3 == 1 ) && RAND:2 == 1
				PRINTFORML 「I can understand wanting to move to Gensokyo, but I can't comprehend why you would choose to live in Higan of all places.」
				PRINTFORMW 「"What if I suddenly die by entering Higan"... Normally I would expect someone to have reservations like this.」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORML 「It worries me a little that someone like you is living in a place populated entirely by women.」
				PRINTFORMW 「I don't fully condemn the existence of base desires, but...」
				PRINTFORMW 「If you don't keep everything in moderation, you will ultimately fall into the Animal Realm. Please keep that in mind.」
			ENDIF
		CASE 12
			TEMP = DAY - TOINT(K30_DIARY_DATA(1, 0))
			SELECTCASE TEMP
				CASE IS < 32
					PRINTFORML 「I think life in Gensokyo would be noticeably different from that of the outside world.」
					PRINTFORMW 「However, the goals and lifestyles of the people here are not so different.」
					PRINTFORMW 「Helping and supporting each other is a critical part of our society.」
				CASE 32 TO 124
					PRINTFORML 「To be honest, I had worried that your arrival was just the herald for some larger troubling incident, but...」
					PRINTFORMW 「I'm relieved that you seem to be living peacefully without causing any major problems.」
					PRINTFORMW 「If only you would adhere to a virtuous life, I would have no further complaints.」
				CASEELSE
					PRINTFORML 「It seems like you've gotten quite accustomed to life here in Gensokyo.」
					PRINTFORML 「I know the rules and standards are different here than the outside world, but...」
					PRINTFORMW 「As long as you adhere to them, there might be some inconveniences but overall I think it's a pleasant place to live.」
			ENDSELECT
		CASE 13
			IF FLAG:おみくじ契約
				PRINTFORML 「...I see. So you've signed an Omikuji contract with the Hakurei shrine maiden.」
				PRINTFORMW 「If it's her, I'm sure they'll be effective within a reasonable limit.」
				PRINTFORML 「However, you must not use them as a way to escape from your responsibilities or failures.」
				PRINTFORMW 「No matter what is written inside, they are nothing more than fortunes. In the end, you are responsible for your actions.」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORML 「...I see. It seems you don't have much belief in fortune-telling or luck.」
				PRINTFORMW 「Certainly, it's not good to push your luck based on the results of a fortune.」
				PRINTFORML 「If one is willing to allow their emotions to be swayed by the contents of a fortune...」
				PRINTFORMW 「It's more productive to live a virtuous life and make one's own luck that way.」
			ENDIF
		CASE 14
			PRINTFORML 「I don't know if you are also misunderstanding, but...」
			PRINTFORML 「My manner of speaking is not particularly long-winded.」
			PRINTFORMW 「I simply have many things to say to those who have many shortcomings.」
		CASE 15
			PRINTFORMW 「There's the concept of a "once-in-a-lifetime encounter", but...」
			PRINTFORML 「You've been able to meet with a Yama while you were still alive.」
			PRINTFORML 「Do you realize how valuable of an opportunity this is?」
			PRINTFORMW 「So rather than let this chance go, you must properly follow my teachings.」
		CASE 16
			PRINTFORML 「People like you, as well as other things...」
			PRINTFORMW 「Recently, there are more and more things besides youkai that have crossed the barrier from outside.」
			PRINTFORML 「I imagine it is a sign of great and sudden changes in the outside world.」
			PRINTFORMW 「But I can't help but worry about what kind of influence such sudden changes will have.」
		CASE 17
			PRINTFORML 「I know that many others treat my teachings as nothing but nagging.」
			PRINTFORMW 「Even I have some degree of self-awareness, after all.」
			PRINTFORML 「However, I do so only with your well-being in mind.」
			PRINTFORMW 「As such, I don't have the slightest intention of changing my ways.」
		CASE 18
			IF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 > 4
				PRINTFORML 「There's something I simply cannot explain about you...」
				PRINTFORML 「How is it that you take the appearance of a human, yet bear power great enough to rival my own?」
				PRINTFORMW 「Could it be that you have some special responsibility like the Hakurei shrine maiden?」
			ELSEIF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 > 1
				PRINTFORML 「It seems you have some capacity for self-defense.」
				PRINTFORML 「However, arrogance and carelessness will only lead you to ruin.」
				PRINTFORMW 「There are many here who hide great danger under a harmless exterior.」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORML 「There's something I simply cannot explain about you...」
				PRINTFORML 「How is it that you can strut around so carelessly with no sense of caution?」
				PRINTFORML 「Man-eating youkai and wild animals... There is no shortage of mortal danger in Gensokyo.」
				PRINTFORMW 「Perhaps you have some power than allows you to escape from any situation?」
			ENDIF
		CASE 19
			IF ABL:MASTER:話術技能 > 3 && RAND:2 == 1
				PRINTFORML 「I must say, you've quite the silver tongue.」
				PRINTFORML 「I don't mean that in a bad way, necessarily.」
				PRINTFORML 「But eloquence alone is meaningless without truth to support it.」
				PRINTFORMW 「Please remember not to use your talents for malice.」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORML 「I don't expect you to understand everything I have to say at once.」
				PRINTFORML 「Rather, you should process my teachings little by little, and internalize them day by day.」
				PRINTFORMW 「A virtuous life is built slowly by iteration. It is not something that can obtained by whimsy or thought alone.」
			ENDIF
		CASE 20
			;セフレ+愛人の人数を算出、映姫様セフレなら0を返す
			TEMP = (SUMCARRAY(TALENT:セフレ, 1) - CMATCH(TALENT:セフレ, 2, 1)) * !(TALENT:セフレ > 0)
			SELECTCASE TEMP
				CASE IS > 6
					PRINTFORML 「Did you come here to Gensokyo just to seduce women?」
					PRINTFORMW 「Though I've only heard rumors about you second-hand, none of them have been flattering.」
					PRINTFORML 「Perhaps you feel that nothing matters as along as you enjoy yourself, but...」
					PRINTFORMW 「I will state this clearly. You will surely come to regret that kind of life someday.」
				CASE IS > 3
					PRINTFORML 「I've heard that you've built a number of improper relationships with women...」
					PRINTFORML 「As long as they are consensual, I'm not in a position to condemn you.」
					PRINTFORMW 「But I would caution you against being too frivolous with a woman's heart.」
					PRINTFORMW 「Otherwise, something might happen to you while walking on a quiet road at night... Such things happen all too frequently.」
				CASE IS > 0
					PRINTFORML 「It seems you've been getting along quite well with multiple people.」
					PRINTFORML 「It's not as if everyone is without emotions or desires, so I can understand this sort of thing.」
					PRINTFORMW 「But please remember to keep everything in moderation.」
				CASE 0
					PRINTFORML 「Humans that come to Gensokyo of their own accord are rare, but not unheard of.」
					PRINTFORML 「You too must have come here of your own volition.」
					PRINTFORML 「I won't ask you your reason, not \@ TALENT:思慕 ? after all this time. # directly. \@」
					PRINTFORMW 「But please remember not to stray from the path of virtue.」
			ENDSELECT
		CASE 21
			PRINTFORML 「"An idle brain is the devil's shop"...」
			PRINTFORMW 「Indeed, I cannot help but worry for someone who wanders around idly like you.」
		CASE 22
			IF ABL:MASTER:教養 > 3 && RAND:2 == 1
				PRINTFORML 「I can see you're quite the educated person, aren't you?」
				PRINTFORMW 「...I see, so you've been studying diligently since you came here to Gensokyo.」
				PRINTFORML 「Certainly, there is knowledge you can find here in Gensokyo that doesn't exist in the outside world.」
				PRINTFORML 「But please be careful. The knowledge you possess must be used for bettering yourself and others.」
				PRINTFORMW 「Simply accumulating knowledge is meaningless.」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORML 「I've heard there are devices in the outside world that allow you to collect information without leaving your home.」
				PRINTFORML 「In some sense, such devices may surpass even my Cleansed Crystal Mirror.」
				PRINTFORML 「However, sometimes an excess of convenience and power can have negative effects.」
				PRINTFORMW 「Concerning this point, I cannot help but feel a little anxious about the outside world.」
			ENDIF
		CASE 23
			PRINTFORML 「I've often heard "Money is the best lawyer in Hell", but...」
			PRINTFORML 「You mustn't be fooled by such lies.」
			PRINTFORMW 「My judgement is absolute. It would never be affected by something like money.」
			PRINTFORML 「Earning a personal fortune as a side effect of living a virtuous life is perfectly fine.」
			PRINTFORML 「But if you are tempted into evil deeds by the personal gain in front of you...」
			PRINTFORMW 「Once you die, you will find yourself unable to pay the ferry toll across the Sanzu River.」
		CASE 24
			PRINTFORML 「Occasionally there are souls who claim there are "cheats" to automatically gain the privilege of reincarnation once you die.」
			PRINTFORML 「The Yama of the outside world lamented of such things to me.」
			PRINTFORML 「Listen carefully, you cannot gain an afterlife greater than what the virtue in your life can purchase.」
			PRINTFORMW 「Keep that in mind as you live your daily life.」
		CASE 25
			PRINTFORML 「Not content with simply crossing the Sanzu River...」
			PRINTFORML 「I've heard you have been merrily visiting everywhere from the depths of the earth to the heavens, to even lunar cities.」
			PRINTFORMW 「I suppose I must commend you, if only for the initiative you show.」
			PRINTFORML 「However, simply wandering about is meaningless.」
			PRINTFORMW 「Instead, you should spend your time doing more productive things, like helping others in need.」
		CASE 26
			PRINTFORML 「There's nothing difficult or unreasonable about my teachings.」
			PRINTFORMW 「I only ask that everyone live each day with virtue and morality.」
			PRINTFORMW 「...Is that truly so strange a suggestion??」
		CASE 27
			PRINTFORML 「If each of you would only spend each day properly building a life of virtue...」
			PRINTFORML 「I would have no need to nag you with my teachings, but...」
			PRINTFORML 「Seeing things as they are now...」
			PRINTFORMW 「I cannot simply stay quiet and turn a blind eye.」
		CASE 28
			PRINTFORML 「Do you have some time?」
			PRINTFORMW 「Please place your hand over your heart and reflect on what you did \@ TIME:2 < 3 ? yesterday # today \@.」
			PRINTFORMW 「...For you, I'm sure nothing but irredeemably wicked acts come to mind.」
			PRINTFORML 「No, I don't plan to punish you here or anything like that.」
			PRINTFORML 「But please consider what you will do next.」
			PRINTFORMW 「If you reflect and avoid repeating the same mistakes, that will itself become virtue in your life.」
		CASE 29
			PRINTFORML 「I think that in Gensokyo, you will often come into close contact with youkai and spirits.」
			PRINTFORML 「Admiring their free-spirited behavior and great power is all well and good.」
			PRINTFORMW 「But living in Gensokyo and throwing away your humanity to become a youkai is an unforgivably grave sin.」
			PRINTFORML 「If you would leave the Human Village in such a state, the Hakurei shrine maiden would surely eradicate you without question.」
			PRINTFORML 「Such a fate would be magnitudes more fearful than my judgement... as you would be facing literal annihilation.」
			PRINTFORMW 「So please take care not to allow strange thoughts to take even the slightest hold in your mind.」
		CASE 30
			PRINTFORML 「"Hearing the same thing over and over again is such a bother."」
			PRINTFORML 「Are you sure you don't think such things when you hear me speak?」
			PRINTFORMW 「If so, you should start by avoiding repeating the same mistakes over and over again.」
		CASE 31
			PRINTFORML 「No one can undo the mistakes of the past.」
			PRINTFORML 「But when considering the future, the one thing you can always change is your attitude.」
			PRINTFORML 「So plan carefully and begin living a life of virtue from now.」
		CASE 32
			PRINTFORML 「Feelings of gratitude or apology only have meaning if properly conveyed.」
			PRINTFORML 「Simply believing others will sense them is a naive way of thinking that must be discarded.」
			PRINTFORML 「I continually repeat the same lessons to everyone because I carry those feelings.」
			PRINTFORMW 「If I don't convey those teachings in a way that can be understood, they have no meaning.」
		CASE 33
			PRINTFORML 「No one is omnipotent, not even the most powerful youkai and gods.」
			PRINTFORML 「Everyone has tasks they find difficult or circumstances they find unfavorable.」
			PRINTFORML 「Therefore, someone like you with a lot of free time can be a valuable resource.」
			PRINTFORMW 「Now, cease your vagrant wanderings and lend a helping hand to those around you.」
		CASE 34
			PRINTFORML 「They say "the child is the father to the man".」
			PRINTFORML 「In that case, did you have some particular attachment to \@ GETBIT(CFLAG:1699, 0) ? women's underwear # women \@ when you were a child...?」
			PRINTFORMW 「...You are truly beyond saving.」
		CASE 35
			PRINTFORML 「There's an old story about a hermit who, despite having mastered the art of flying, fell to earth after being smitten by a woman.」
			PRINTFORMW 「If all you do is keep chasing after women, you too will meet misfortune someday.」
		CASE 36
			PRINTFORML 「It's important to treat others the way you would like to be treated.」
			PRINTFORML 「Consideration, kindness, and words of appreciation.」
			PRINTFORMW 「After all, people must strive to deepen their relationships with each other.」
			PRINTFORML 「...I'm sure you already understand this, but I'll remind you anyway.」
			PRINTFORML 「Touching and groping other women with abandon, in the hopes they reciprocate...」
			PRINTFORMW 「None could call that virtue... Please exercise some restraint.」
		CASE 37
			PRINTFORML 「As Gensokyo is isolated from the outside world by a barrier, it may appear as if each day is the same as the last.」
			PRINTFORML 「But even within the barrier, time passes and the seasons change.」
			PRINTFORML 「Indeed, no matter how powerful one may be, none can escape the flow of time.」
			PRINTFORMW 「Therefore, you must build a life of virtue to prepare for the day you inevitably face judgement.」
		CASE 38
			PRINTFORML 「I don't believe in complete denial of worldly desires.」
			PRINTFORMW 「As long as warm blood flows through the veins of humans, hunger and sleep are necessary to fuel the spark of life.」
			PRINTFORML 「...However, your carnal desire is far too intense.」
			PRINTFORML 「The spark of life must not become a raging fire that consumes its host.」
			PRINTFORMW 「You would do well to exercise some self-control.」
		CASE 39
			PRINTFORML 「It is said that one of the Buddha's disciples reached enlightenment by constantly cleaning with singleminded devotion.」
			PRINTFORMW 「Perhaps one day even you could...」
			PRINTFORML 「...」
			PRINTFORMW 「...I'm sorry, I must admit it is difficult to imagine you ever reaching enlightenment.」
	ENDSELECT
	回数 = (回数 == (分岐量 - 1)) ? 0 # 回数 + 1
ENDIF
RETURN 1
