		PRINTFORMD Eiki stands still as she 
		PRINTDATAD
			DATA tries to press down the front of her shirt.
			DATA tries to pull down the hem of the uncomfortably short skirt.
			DATA darts her eyes around the area.
		ENDDATA
	ELSEIF TALENT:キス魔 && TALENT:恋人 && K30_BE_SEEN() == 0 && !MARK:反発刻印
		PRINTFORML 「...Shouldn't lovers be spending their time in a more... meaningful fashion?」
		PRINTFORMW 「Such as...」
		PRINTFORMW ...Chuu♥
		PRINTFORMW 「Fufu, don't worry, no one's here...♥」
	ELSEIF TALENT:恋慕
		IF RAND:2 == 1
			PRINTFORMW 「Spending time idly like this makes me feel strangely uneasy...」
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMDL You glance over at Eiki to see her fidgeting about nervously...
			PRINTFORMDW She's probably suppressing her instinct to lecture you.
		ENDIF
	ELSEIF TALENT:思慕
		PRINTFORMDL Eiki is glancing suggestively at you...
		PRINTFORMW 「...!」
		PRINTFORMDW Your eyes meet for a brief moment, and she hastily averts her gaze.
	ELSE
		PRINTFORML 「Spending time doing nothing at all... What nonsense are you spouting?」
		PRINTFORML 「No matter how we choose to spend our time, it passes equally for all of us.」
		PRINTFORML 「What do you hope to accomplish by allowing it pass by fruitlessly with no purpose...」
		PRINTFORMDW Relaxing with a Yama sure is hard...
	ENDIF
ENDIF
RETURN 1
