;448,罠を仕掛ける／虫トラップ
;TFLAG:193,
;   -1=罠が壊れた
;    0=罠を仕掛けた
;    1=獲物が得られた
;   10=虫トラップを仕掛けた
;   11=虫トラップを破棄した
;   12=ムシを捕まえた
;TFLAG:194,獲物の番号
;ムシの名前は MUSHI_NAME で表示したり判別したりできます
;==================================================
@M_KOJO_MESSAGE_COM_K30_448
CALL M_KOJO_MESSAGE_COM_K30_448_1
RETURN RESULT

@M_KOJO_MESSAGE_COM_K30_448_1
;-------------------------------------------------
;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------------------------------------------
IF LOCAL
	;コマンド段階で弾かれてる気がするけど念のため
	SIF !SHIRAHU(30) || 仕事中チェック(30)
		RETURN
	;バイブデート
	IF TCVAR:30:364
		CALL HPH_PRINT, @"「Nn...HPH Nnnn... AfuuHPH」", "L"
		PRINTFORMDW Eiki watches you work from afar on unsteady feet.
		PRINTFORML 
		CALL HPH_PRINT, @"「Yes...HPH My butt... So, good...HPH」", "L"
		PRINTFORMDW ...Though she's facing your direction, she doesn't seem to pay much heed to what you're actually doing.
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	SELECTCASE TFLAG:193
		;罠が壊れた
		CASE -1
			PRINTDATAW
				DATAFORM 「All living things do their best to survive each day.」\n「They won't allow themselves to be caught so easily.」
				DATAFORM 「Though this may be cold comfort to you, as you've lost a trap...」\n「Why not think positively, that an animal has been allowed to live a little longer?」
				DATAFORM 「Doesn't it seem like this trap was destroyed from the outside, after catching something...?」\n「Perhaps the victim was saved by one of its brethren.」
				DATAFORM 「There are many instances of animals outsmarting humans.」\n「After all, animals are also doing their best to survive.」\n「There's always next time.」
			ENDDATA
		;罠を仕掛けた
		CASE 0
			SELECTCASE RAND:4
				CASE 0
					PRINTFORML 「If you're going to lay a trap, please be sure to check on it often.」
					PRINTFORMW 「Leaving an animal caught in the trap will only lengthen its suffering.」
				CASE 1
					PRINTFORML 「I understand you also need to do what you must to support yourself.」
					PRINTFORML 「I don't plan to fault you for that.」
					PRINTFORML 「But please take care only to catch as many animals as strictly necessary.」
					PRINTFORMW 「I won't overlook hunting simply for sport.」
				CASE 2
					PRINTFORML 「I understand you want to hide the trap well to increase its effectiveness, but we must avoid accidents.」
					PRINTFORMW 「Couldn't you %TEXTR("setup an accompanying warning message/put it somewhere a little more visible")%?」
				CASE 3
					PRINTFORML 「When preparing bait for a trap, you should use something that won't entice people.」
					PRINTFORML 「Otherwise, a careless person looking for something to eat could...」
					PRINTFORMW 「After all, you never know when a certain hungry phantom or poverty god might stumble upon it.」
					PRINTFORMW 「...I'm sure you can imagine it too, can't you?」
			ENDSELECT
		;獲物が得られた
		CASE 1
			SELECTCASE TFLAG:194
				;ヘビ/デスワーム/スライム→怪しげな肉
				CASE 20, 23, 25
					SELECTCASE RAND:3
						CASE 0
							PRINTFORML 「So even you find some things unappetizing.」
							PRINTFORMW 「To be completely honest, I thought you'd happily eat anything and everything.」
						CASE 1
							PRINTFORML 「Though your prize may be somewhat dubious, you must take responsibility for what you've caught.」
							PRINTFORMW 「Please do your best with the cooking.」
						CASE 2
							PRINTFORML 「I have a proposal for you.」
							PRINTFORMW 「It seems you're a bit unsure of how to prepare this... Why not simply cover it in fiery spices?」
							PRINTFORML 「It should help reduce the bitterness and even act in some capacity as an antiseptic.」
							PRINTFORML 「And most importantly... It will increase the chances of making an appetizing dish!」
							PRINTFORML 「I strongly recommend this course of action.」
							PRINTFORMDW The Yama is doing her best to push her own tastes onto you.
					ENDSELECT
				;マタンゴ→ヤバいキノコ
				CASE 26
					PRINTFORML 「To catch something without eating it is a waste of life, but...」
					PRINTFORML 「This isn't edible, is it...」
					PRINTFORMW 「What even is this, in the first place...?」
					PRINTFORMW 「Animal? Or fungus?」
					PRINTFORML 「...A mushroom person?」
					PRINTFORMDW The Yama doesn't seem to know what to think about the strange organism.
				;ローター
				CASE 31
					PRINTFORMW 「...」
					PRINTFORML 「This isn't something a normal person could catch in a trap...」
					PRINTFORML 「...Perhaps things like this are simply drawn to you?」
					PRINTFORMDW Eiki seems appalled...
				;いわゆるまともな肉
				CASEELSE
					SELECTCASE RAND:5
						CASE 0
							PRINTFORML 「...I understand your excitement at catching something to eat.」
							PRINTFORML 「But before thinking about how to prepare it, shouldn't you first show gratitude to the animal you are about to make your meal?」
							PRINTFORML 「We cannot avoid taking life to extend our own.」
							PRINTFORMW 「But forgetting the value of each life would make us lower than animals.」
							PRINTFORML 「Now listen here, there is a realm of Hell for those who take life out of greed.」
							PRINTFORML 「Just like yourself right now...」
							PRINTFORML 「......that arrogance will...」
							PRINTFORML 「...you should take some care to......」
							PRINTFORML 「......」
							PRINTFORMDW Eiki's gone into lecture mode...
						CASE 1
							PRINTFORML 「There are traces of a violent struggle all around the trap...」
							PRINTFORMW 「The victim must have desperately tried to escape.」
							PRINTFORML 「I'm sure that you, as a hunter, are already fully aware of this, but...」
							PRINTFORMW 「You must never forget your gratitude to the lives you take as food.」
						CASE 2
							PRINTFORML 「Sin naturally accompanies the act of living.」
							PRINTFORML 「It is only because of the lives of animals such as this that people like you can survive.」
							PRINTFORMW 「You must build a life of virtue to ensure that their sacrifices are not in vain.」
						CASE 3
							PRINTFORMW 「This truly is high-quality meat.」
							PRINTFORML 「As to how to prepare it... A number of ideas come to mind.」
							PRINTFORML 「Spicy... Very spicy... Extremely spicy...」
							PRINTFORML 「Perhaps this might even be an opportunity to push the limits of spiciness.」
							PRINTFORMDW Eiki seems rather biased in her suggestions...
						CASE 4
							PRINTFORML 「Please be careful when draining the blood and preparing the meat as not to damage it.」
							PRINTFORML 「There's nothing wrong with looking forward to the meal, but...」
							PRINTFORMW 「You must not forget your gratitude towards the animal while preparing it with care.」
					ENDSELECT
			ENDSELECT
		;虫トラップを仕掛けた
		CASE 10
			PRINTFORML 「Are you preparing for a bug battle?」
			IF CFLAG:30:ムシバトル直接勝利
				PRINTDATAW
					DATAFORM 「I would like to be your opponent once again, as well.」\n「I'll give it my all to learn from you.」
					DATAFORM 「I'm quite proud of my own roster of insects, but...」\n「Perhaps I should reconsider...?」
					DATAFORM 「Though it seems quite simple... It's deeper than I expected.」\n「I can see why it's so popular.」
				ENDDATA
			ELSE
				PRINTDATAW
					DATAFORM 「Bug battles are rather interesting, aren't they?」\n「It's a nice way to let out some stress.」
					DATAFORM 「There's actually an opponent I haven't been able to defeat...」\n「Though I would like to take a win, I'm lost as to how...」
					DATAFORM 「I'd like my insect roster to have an all black-and-white theme, but...」\n「Where should I look for them...?」
				ENDDATA
			ENDIF
		;虫トラップを破棄した
		CASE 11
			IF RAND:2 == 1
				PRINTFORML 「If you're not having much luck, why not try changing the bait or location?」
				PRINTFORMW 「Other than that, it's just a matter of patience.」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORML 「There's no way to find good insects other than through trial and error.」
				PRINTFORMW 「The only way to evaluate them is to test them out for yourself.」
			ENDIF
		;虫を捕まえた
		CASE 12
			PRINTDATAW
				DATAFORM 「Congratulations.」\n「Did you find what you were looking for?」
				DATAFORM 「Even the smallest insect is a life, so please treat it with care.」
				DATAFORM 「Were you able to catch something?」\n「If it's not what you were looking for, please return it where you found it.」
			ENDDATA
	ENDSELECT
ENDIF
RETURN 1
