		;ブラックサンダー
		PRINTFORML 「Ehh, I have to admit this is a little underwhelming...」
		IF CFLAG:バレンタイン > 102
			PRINTFORMW 「You're going to have to try a little harder than that.」
			PRINTFORML 「For example... Hmm...」
			PRINTFORMW 「...Maybe I could have some of your time later, or something...」
		ELSE
			PRINTFORML 「Well, I suppose it's the thought that counts.」
			PRINTFORMW 「I'll accept this gratefully.」
		ENDIF
	CASE 2
		;ローターチョコ
		PRINTFORML 「Some things never change... It's always one outlandish thing after another with you.」
		PRINTFORMW 「But what I really can't get over is that it still tastes good...」
	CASE 3
		;WDチョコレート
		;まだ無い？
	CASE 4
		;手作りチョコクッキー
		PRINTFORML 「Oh, this is quite lovely... Did you bake this yourself?」
		PRINTFORMW 「It looks very skillfully made.」
		IF CFLAG:バレンタイン > 102
			PRINTFORML 「Mmm, it seems a waste to eat it alone.」
			PRINTFORMW 「Would you like to have some together?」
		ELSE
			PRINTFORML 「Perhaps I'll have some with tea during work.」
			PRINTFORMW 「%K30_C_NAME(MASTER)%, thank you very much.」
		ENDIF
	CASE 5
		;WDプディング
		;まだ無い？
	CASE 6
		;手作りプディング
		PRINTFORML 「This looks like quite the intricate dessert...」
		IF CFLAG:バレンタイン > 102
			PRINTFORMW 「Did you make this for me...?」
			PRINTFORML 「I'm always receiving such wonderful gifts from you... I feel a little guilty.」
			PRINTFORMW 「I appreciate your kindness, thank you.」
		ELSE
			PRINTFORML 「I didn't expect to receive something so extravagant in return.」
			PRINTFORML 「I'll gratefully accept, then.」
			PRINTFORMW 「%K30_C_NAME(MASTER)%, thank you very much.」
		ENDIF
	CASE 7
		;デコレーションケーキ
		;バフやべぇ
		PRINTFORML 「Ehhh?! This cake... is really something...」
		IF CFLAG:バレンタイン < 103
			PRINTFORML 「I mean, to receive this in return for \@ CFLAG:バレンタイン < 102 ? that kind of # just \@ chocolate... Anyone would be surprised...」
			PRINTFORML 「What should I do... There must be something else I can do in return...」
			PRINTFORMDL Eiki seems to be flustered by your super fancy return gift...
			PRINTFORML 
			PRINTFORML 「...I've tried my hardest to think of something I could do.」
			PRINTFORMW 「In return for this cake... I will offer my time and teachings.」
			PRINTFORML 「I've heard one should return a favor threefold, but...」
			PRINTFORMW 「In order to provide you the utmost assistance in virtue, rather than just threefold, I will speak to you of virtue for as long as you...」
			PRINTFORMDW You politely see yourself out.
		ELSEIF !TALENT:恋慕
			PRINTFORMW 「Shall I take this... to represent your feelings for me...?」
			PRINTFORML 「I'm very happy to receive this, it's just... I'm not sure how to respond...」
			PRINTFORMW 「I-In any case... Thank you very much.」
		ELSE
			SELECTCASE K30_FIND_LOVER()
				CASE -1
					PRINTFORMW 「%K30_C_NAME(MASTER)%, thank you for this wonderful return gift.」
					PRINTFORMW 「This might seem a little boorish of me, but could I taste it right now...?」
					PRINTFORMDL Eiki scoops a little of the frosting with her finger and puts it in her mouth...
					PRINTFORML 「...Chuu♥」
					PRINTFORMDW ...And kisses you like that.
					PRINTFORML 「Fufu, %K30_C_NAME(MASTER)%... What do you think?」
					PRINTFORMW 「It's very sweet... and full of happiness, don't you think?♥」
				CASE 0
					PRINTFORML 「So you've... made this just for me...」
					PRINTFORMW 「Thank you... Thank you so much.」
					PRINTFORML 「...To receive such a wonderful return gift...」
					PRINTFORMW 「Perhaps I can... expect a little more...?」
				CASEELSE
					PRINTFORMW 「Umm... Is this okay? You haven't... mixed up the recipient, have you?」
					PRINTFORML 「Ah, no, I'm very happy... It's just...」
					PRINTFORMW 「Is it really okay for me to take this...」
			ENDSELECT
		ENDIF
ENDSELECT
RETURN 1

